  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wet 203.19 Request to Confirm Consistency with Council Order",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wet 203.19 Request to Confirm Consistency with Council Order.\n\n(a) A request by a party pursuant to RSA 21-O:14, I-a(d) to confirm that a revised decision by the commissioner is consistent with the council’s remand order shall:\n\n(1) Be in writing and conform to the filing requirements of Ec-Wet 203.04; and\n\n(2) Include a copy of the revised decision.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a request under paragraph (a) above, the presiding officer shall, within 30 days:\n\n(1) Rule on the request, if he or she determines that doing so does not require consultation with the council; or\n\n(2) Refer the request to the council for resolution at its next scheduled meeting.\n\n(c) A request under paragraph (a) above shall not entitle the requester to a hearing.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wet 100) #13305, eff 12-15-21\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nEc-Wet 101 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wet 102 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wet 103 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wet 104 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nEc-Wet 201 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(3); RSA 541-A:16, I(c); RSA 541-A:11; RSA 541-A:4\n\nEc-Wet 202 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(d)\n\nEc-Wet 203 | RSA 21-O:5-a, VII; RSA 21-O:14, VI; RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(2); RSA 541-A:30-a",
